          "path": "D:/Programacion/caminosysabores/public/sitio/reuniones.html",
          "name": "reuniones.html",
          "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>San Juan a la mesa - Reuniones Comex y Prensa</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/sorteo.css\">\n    <style>\n        .reuniones-hero {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5A2828, #E6643C);\n            padding: 60px 30px;\n            text-align: left;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .reuniones-hero h1 {\n            font-size: 2.8rem;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .reuniones-tabs {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n            margin: 30px;\n        }\n        .reuniones-tab {\n            flex: 1;\n            padding: 15px;\n            text-align: center;\n            background: #f0f0f0;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n        .reuniones-tab.active {\n            background: #E6643C;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .reuniones-panel {\n            display: none;\n            padding: 0 30px;\n        }\n        .reuniones-panel.active {\n            display: block;\n        }\n        .reuniones-descripcion {\n            font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #333;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        .reuniones-descripcion p {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            .reuniones-hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }\n            .reuniones-tabs { flex-direction: column; }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <main>\n        <div class=\"reuniones-hero\">\n            <span class=\"produccion-etiqueta\" style=\"color:#F0E6DC;\">PRODUCCIONES</span>\n            <h1>Reuniones<br>Comex y<br>Prensa</h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"reuniones-tabs\">\n            <button class=\"reuniones-tab active\" onclick=\"mostrarPanel('comex', this)\">Comex</button>\n            <button class=\"reuniones-tab\" onclick=\"mostrarPanel('prensa', this)\">Prensa</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Panel Comex -->\n        <div id=\"panel-comex\" class=\"reuniones-panel active\">\n            <div class=\"reuniones-descripcion\">\n                <p>Este espacio está pensado para empresas, comercios, distribuidores, compradores y personas interesadas en conocer la oferta exportable de San Juan.</p>\n                <p>Coordiná un encuentro durante Caminos y Sabores para conocer más sobre los productos sanjuaninos, conectar con productores y explorar oportunidades de negocio.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-container\">\n                <h2>Formulario de reserva</h2>\n                <p>Completá tus datos y te contactamos</p>\n                <form id=\"form-comex\">\n                    <div class=\"form-row\">\n                        <div class=\"form-group half\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Nombre\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"form-group half\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Apellido\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Correo electrónico\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Empresa\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Cargo/Rol\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Motivo de la reunión\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Seleccioná un horario\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"submit-container\">\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit-button\">\n                            <span style=\"display:block;background:#E6643C;color:white;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:25px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:bold;font-family:'Ubuntu',sans-serif;border:none;cursor:pointer;\">Enviar</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Panel Prensa -->\n        <div id=\"panel-prensa\" class=\"reuniones-panel\">\n            <div class=\"reuniones-descripcion\">\n                <p>Este espacio está destinado a medios, periodistas, creadores de contenido y equipos de prensa interesados en cubrir la presencia de San Juan en Caminos y Sabores.</p>\n                <p>Completá el formulario y el equipo correspondiente podrá contactarte para brindarte más información y coordinar entrevistas.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"form-container\">\n                <h2>Formulario de reserva</h2>\n                <p>Completá tus datos para contactarte</p>\n                <form id=\"form-prensa\">\n                    <div class=\"form-row\">\n                        <div class=\"form-group half\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Nombre\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"form-group half\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Apellido\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Correo electrónico\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Medio\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Temática de la entrevista\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Seleccioná un horario\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"submit-container\">\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit-button\">\n                            <span style=\"display:block;background:#E6643C;color:white;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:25px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:bold;font-family:'Ubuntu',sans-serif;border:none;cursor:pointer;\">Enviar</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"js/header.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"js/footer.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"js/touch.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        function mostrarPanel(panel, btn) {\n            document.querySelectorAll('.reuniones-panel').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\n            document.querySelectorAll('.reuniones-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n            document.getElementById('panel-' + panel).classList.add('active');\n            btn.classList.add('active');\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
        },
