          "content": "    <!-- ─── TAB: TALLERES ─── -->\n    <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-talleres\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2>&#128218; Inscripciones a Talleres</h2>\n                <div class=\"section-actions\">\n                    <button class=\"btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filtrarTaller('todas')\" id=\"filtroTallerTodas\">Todos</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filtrarTaller('taller-de-siembra')\" id=\"filtroTallerSiembra\">Siembra</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filtrarTaller('aceite-de-oliva')\" id=\"filtroTallerAceite\">Aceite</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filtrarTaller('vino')\" id=\"filtroTallerVino\">Vino</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filtrarTaller('maridaje')\" id=\"filtroTallerMaridaje\">Maridaje</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filtrarTaller('senti-san-juan')\" id=\"filtroTallerSenti\">Sentí</button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"stats-row\">\n                <div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"num\" id=\"tallerTotal\">0</div><div class=\"label\">Total</div></div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"num\" id=\"tallerConfirmados\">0</div><div class=\"label\">Confirmados</div></div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"num\" id=\"tallerEspera\">0</div><div class=\"label\">Lista Espera</div></div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"num\" id=\"tallerCanjeados\">0</div><div class=\"label\">Canjeados</div></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Config section -->\n            <div class=\"section-card\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n                <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n                    <h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.9rem;\">&#9881; Configuración de Cupos</h3>\n                    <span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#888;\">Default: <strong id=\"tallerCupoDefaultLabel\">15</strong></span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;\">\n                    <select id=\"tallerConfigSelector\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.8rem;\">\n                        <option value=\"\">Seleccionar taller...</option>\n                    </select>\n                    <input type=\"number\" id=\"tallerCupoInput\" value=\"15\" min=\"1\" max=\"200\" style=\"width:60px;padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.8rem;\">\n                    <span style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#666;\">cupos</span>\n                    <button class=\"btn-primary btn-sm\" onclick=\"guardarConfigTaller()\">Guardar</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"guardarCupoDefault()\">Default: <span id=\"tallerCupoDefaultBtn\">15</span></button>\n                </div>\n                <p style=\"font-size:0.7rem;color:#999;margin:6px 0 0;\">Dejá vacío en \"Seleccionar taller\" para configurar el cupo default (aplica a todos los talleres sin configuración específica).</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"table-wrap\" id=\"tallerTableWrap\">\n                <div class=\"loading-state\" id=\"tallerLoading\">Cargando inscripciones...</div>\n                <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"tallerEmpty\" style=\"display:none\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 14l-5-5 1.41-1.41L12 14.17l7.59-7.59L21 8l-9 9z\"/></svg>\n                    <p>No hay inscripciones a talleres</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n"
